        "text_YYjgFV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Shelby Johnson began her career with NADCO in 2005, starting as a pre-flighter in New Hampshire. Over time, she honed her skills and advanced into production management, where she continues to make a significant impact today. Shelby takes great pride in the company’s commitment to delivering custom solutions, and her dedication to ensuring each project is executed flawlessly is evident in her approach to leadership.</p><p>Known for her problem-solving ability, Shelby prides herself on always being able to “figure it out,” no matter the challenge. Her deep sense of ownership and commitment to quality has been instrumental in instilling the same values in her team. Shelby fosters an environment of excellence, emphasizing the importance of precision, teamwork, and taking pride in every job completed.</p><p>Outside of her professional life, Shelby enjoys spending time on the golf course or relaxing at the beach, where she finds balance and refreshment away from work.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
